# Keep the checkout identical on every platform, so the repository does not depend
# on each developer's core.autocrlf. The i18n catalog test (src-tauri/src/lang.rs)
# reads the .rs files as text and cuts them at "#[cfg(test)]"; with CRLF working
# copies that cut silently failed and the test asked for translations of strings
# that only exist inside the tests.
* text=auto eol=lf

# PowerShell verbs run on Windows; Windows PowerShell 5.1 expects CRLF.
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# The Nautilus and Nemo helpers run on Linux.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch the bytes.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.docx binary
